Example 3: Pyramid Patterns with Numbers





def print_number_pyramid(rows):
    for i in range(1, rows + 1):
        for j in range(rows - i):
            print(" ", end="")
        for j in range(2 * i - 1):
            print(j + 1, end="")
        print()
​
print_number_pyramid(5)

Output
    1
   123
  12345
 1234567
123456789
