Example 5: Hollow Pyramid





print("GFG")
def hollow_pyramid(n):
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        for j in range(1, 2 * n):
            if j == n - i + 1 or j == n + i - 1 or i == n:
                print("*", end="")
            else:
                print(" ", end="")
        print()
​
hollow_pyramid(5)

Output
GFG
    *    
   * *   
  *   *  
 *     * 
